        "hubspot-crm-product",
        "hubspot-sales-product",
        "hubspot-product-catalog"
      ],
      "isEditorial": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "other",
      "description": "Sales Hub Professional starts at $100/month per seat on the Product & Services Catalog and the Sales product page (re-checked 2026-08-18). HubSpot’s Sales pricing page also shows $90/mo/seat billed annually vs $100 monthly, plus required Professional onboarding ($1,500). Starter marketing prices show new-customer discounts (*).",
      "sourceIds": [
        "hubspot-sales-product",
        "hubspot-product-catalog",
        "hubspot-sales-pricing",
        "hubspot-crm-product"
      ],
      "isEditorial": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "requires-add-on",
      "description": "Full GTM stack (Marketing Hub, Service Hub, etc.) is sold as additional hubs with their own seat/contact pricing — not included in Free CRM alone.",
